---
import Todo from '../components/Todo.astro';
import site from '../content/site.json';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

// Plain-English privacy policy covering what this website actually collects: booking and catering
// requests, online orders and card payments. The restaurant should read it before it goes live.
---

<Layout title="Privacy policy" description={`How ${site.name} collects, uses and protects the details you give us when you order online.`} crumb="Privacy policy">
  <article class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <p class="eyebrow text-meta">Privacy</p>
      <h1 class="text-display-lg">Privacy policy</h1>
      <p class="text-body-lg prose__lede">We ask only for what we need to look after your order, and we never sell your details.</p>
      <p class="text-body-sm prose__muted">Last updated 27 November 2026.</p>

      <h2 class="text-heading-lg">Who we are</h2>
      <p>{site.name} is a Punjabi restaurant at <Todo text={site.address} />. In this policy, "we" and "us" mean {site.name}. We handle personal information in line with the Australian Privacy Principles.</p>

      <h2 class="text-heading-lg">What we collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Online orders:</strong> your name, phone number, what you order and your pickup time.</li>
        <li><strong>Card payments:</strong> card details are entered directly into Stripe, our payment provider. They go straight to Stripe and we never see or store your full card number.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We don't ask for anything else, and you don't need an account to order. Table bookings and catering enquiries are taken by phone, not through this website.</p>

      <h2 class="text-heading-lg">How we use it</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To prepare your order and contact you about it.</li>
        <li>To prepare your food safely, including any allergies or dietary needs you tell us about.</li>
        <li>To keep records we are required to keep, such as payment and tax records.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We won't add you to a mailing list or send you marketing unless you ask us to.</p>

      <h2 class="text-heading-lg">Who we share it with</h2>
      <p>Only the services we use to run the restaurant and this website, and only what each one needs:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Our point-of-sale system</strong>, which receives online orders so the kitchen can prepare them.</li>
        <li><strong>Stripe</strong>, which processes card payments. See <a href="https://stripe.com/au/privacy" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Stripe's privacy policy</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Our website host</strong>, which stores order records securely while your order is being prepared.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We may also disclose information if the law requires it.</p>

      <h2 class="text-heading-lg">Maps and fonts</h2>
      <p>The map on our Visit page is provided by Google Maps, and some of our lettering comes from Google Fonts. When these load, Google receives your IP address and browser details, as it would on any website that uses them. See <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Google's privacy policy</a>.</p>

      <h2 class="text-heading-lg">How we keep it safe</h2>
      <p>Our website uses HTTPS, card payments are handled entirely by Stripe, and only the people who need your details to serve you can see them. We keep order and booking records only as long as we need them, or as long as the law requires.</p>

      <h2 class="text-heading-lg">Your choices</h2>
      <p>You can ask to see the details we hold about you, ask us to correct them, or ask us to delete them where we are not required to keep them. If you have a concern about how we have handled your information, please tell us first and we will try to put it right. If you are not satisfied, you can contact the <a href="https://www.oaic.gov.au/" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Office of the Australian Information Commissioner</a>.</p>

      <h2 class="text-heading-lg">Contact us</h2>
      <p>Call us on <a href={site.phoneHref}><Todo text={site.phone} /></a>, or speak to us at the restaurant.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>

<style>
  .prose { display: grid; gap: var(--space-4); max-width: var(--measure-prose); padding-top: var(--space-8); padding-bottom: var(--space-9); }
  .prose h2 { margin-top: var(--space-6); }
  .prose ul { display: grid; gap: var(--space-2); padding-left: 1.25em; list-style: disc; }
  .prose__lede, .prose__muted { color: var(--ink-secondary); }
</style>
